### Checking Hotelservice unavailability

### Информация о Hotel Service в Eureka
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps/HOTEL-SERVICE
Accept: application/json

### Исключить Hotel Service из маршрутизации Eureka
PUT http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps/HOTEL-SERVICE/ERV-W0013.infotecs-nt:hotel-service:8082/status?value=OUT_OF_SERVICE

### Проверить статус Hotel Service
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps/HOTEL-SERVICE
Accept: application/json

### Вернуть Hotel Service в работу
DELETE http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps/HOTEL-SERVICE/ERV-W0013.infotecs-nt:hotel-service:8082/status?value=UP

### Проверка отказа Hotel Service
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 8e52e7b8-1e67-41c6-a4d2-4c1ef9b12001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkIn": "2028-12-10",
  "checkOut": "2028-12-13"
}

